Error [E0204]: `editor` is already shared in this call, so it can't be changed here too
  --> generic_method_trait_and_function_value_calls_share_place_access_2.jet:8:19
    |
  8 |     editor.clash(&editor)
    |                   ^^^^^^
 Why: While something is being looked at, nobody else may be changing it
 Fix: Drop the extra use of `editor`, or copy first with `~editor`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
